# Family input, timing and validation (plan 04-11 Task 2, D-05, D-14): equal ticks keep array order
# (literal chains h2 and g2), an event at a slice target and events inside overshoot windows apply
# in the next call (four slicings equal one call byte for byte), a halted CPU with the stop flag
# applies nothing, reset returns the row to h0, two interleaved instances equal their solo runs,
# 65536 events run. Refusals (event slot after the buffers; per-event stages after
